---Definition of awsEc2InstanceStatus
---@class azure.awsconnector.AwsEc2InstanceStatusProperties
---@field availabilityZone? string <p>The Availability Zone of the instance.</p>
---@field events? azure.awsconnector.AwsEc2InstanceStatusPropertiesEventsList <p>Any scheduled events associated with the instance.</p>
---@field instanceId? string <p>The ID of the instance.</p>
---@field instanceState? azure.awsconnector.InstanceState <p>The intended state of the instance. <a>DescribeInstanceStatus</a> requires that an instance be in the <code>running</code> state.</p>
