---@alias azure.awsconnector.AwsEc2KeyPairPropertiesKeyType "ed25519"|"rsa"

---The tags to apply to the key pair.
---@alias azure.awsconnector.AwsEc2KeyPairPropertiesTagsList azure.awsconnector.Tag_15[]

---Definition of awsEc2NetworkAcl
---@class azure.awsconnector.AwsEc2NetworkAclProperties
