---Definition of awsOpenSearchDomainStatus
---@class azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusProperties
---@field arn? string <p>The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the domain. For more information, see <a href='https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_identifiers.html'>IAM identifiers </a> in the <i>AWS Identity and Access Management User Guide</i>.</p>
---@field accessPolicies? string <p>Identity and Access Management (IAM) policy document specifying the access policies for the domain.</p>
---@field advancedOptions? azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusPropertiesAdvancedOptionsMap <p>Key-value pairs that specify advanced configuration options.</p>
---@field advancedSecurityOptions? azure.awsconnector.AdvancedSecurityOptions <p>Settings for fine-grained access control.</p>
---@field autoTuneOptions? azure.awsconnector.AutoTuneOptionsOutput <p>Auto-Tune settings for the domain.</p>
---@field changeProgressDetails? azure.awsconnector.ChangeProgressDetails <p>Information about a configuration change happening on the domain.</p>
---@field clusterConfig? azure.awsconnector.ClusterConfig <p>Container for the cluster configuration of the domain.</p>
---@field cognitoOptions? azure.awsconnector.CognitoOptions <p>Key-value pairs to configure Amazon Cognito authentication for OpenSearch Dashboards.</p>
---@field created? boolean <p>Creation status of an OpenSearch Service domain. True if domain creation is complete. False if domain creation is still in progress.</p>
---@field deleted? boolean <p>Deletion status of an OpenSearch Service domain. True if domain deletion is complete. False if domain deletion is still in progress. Once deletion is complete, the status of the domain is no longer returned.</p>
---@field domainEndpointOptions? azure.awsconnector.DomainEndpointOptions <p>Additional options for the domain endpoint, such as whether to require HTTPS for all traffic.</p>
---@field domainId? string <p>Unique identifier for the domain.</p>
---@field domainName? string <p>Name of the domain. Domain names are unique across all domains owned by the same account within an Amazon Web Services Region.</p>
---@field domainProcessingStatus? azure.awsconnector.DomainProcessingStatusTypeEnumValue <p>The status of any changes that are currently in progress for the domain.</p>
---@field ebsOptions? azure.awsconnector.EBSOptions <p>Container for EBS-based storage settings for the domain.</p>
---@field encryptionAtRestOptions? azure.awsconnector.EncryptionAtRestOptions <p>Encryption at rest settings for the domain.</p>
---@field endpoint? string <p>Domain-specific endpoint used to submit index, search, and data upload requests to the domain.</p>
---@field endpointV2? string <p>If <code>IPAddressType</code> to set to <code>dualstack</code>, a version 2 domain endpoint is provisioned. This endpoint functions like a normal endpoint, except that it works with both IPv4 and IPv6 IP addresses. Normal endpoints work only with IPv4 IP addresses. </p>
---@field endpoints? azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusPropertiesEndpointsMap <p>The key-value pair that exists if the OpenSearch Service domain uses VPC endpoints. Example <code>key, value</code>: <code>'vpc','vpc-endpoint-h2dsd34efgyghrtguk5gt6j2foh4.us-east-1.es.amazonaws.com'</code>.</p>
---@field engineVersion? string <p>Version of OpenSearch or Elasticsearch that the domain is running, in the format <code>Elasticsearch_X.Y</code> or <code>OpenSearch_X.Y</code>.</p>
---@field ipAddressType? azure.awsconnector.IPAddressTypeEnumValue <p>The type of IP addresses supported by the endpoint for the domain.</p>
---@field logPublishingOptions? azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusPropertiesLogPublishingOptionsMap <p>Log publishing options for the domain.</p>
---@field modifyingProperties? azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusPropertiesModifyingPropertiesList <p>Information about the domain properties that are currently being modified.</p>
---@field nodeToNodeEncryptionOptions? azure.awsconnector.NodeToNodeEncryptionOptions <p>Whether node-to-node encryption is enabled or disabled.</p>
---@field offPeakWindowOptions? azure.awsconnector.OffPeakWindowOptions <p>Options that specify a custom 10-hour window during which OpenSearch Service can perform configuration changes on the domain.</p>
---@field processing? boolean <p>The status of the domain configuration. True if OpenSearch Service is processing configuration changes. False if the configuration is active.</p>
---@field serviceSoftwareOptions? azure.awsconnector.ServiceSoftwareOptions <p>The current status of the domain's service software.</p>
---@field snapshotOptions? azure.awsconnector.SnapshotOptions <p>DEPRECATED. Container for parameters required to configure automated snapshots of domain indexes.</p>
---@field softwareUpdateOptions? azure.awsconnector.SoftwareUpdateOptions <p>Service software update options for the domain.</p>
---@field upgradeProcessing? boolean <p>The status of a domain version upgrade to a new version of OpenSearch or Elasticsearch. True if OpenSearch Service is in the process of a version upgrade. False if the configuration is active.</p>
---@field vpcOptions? azure.awsconnector.VPCDerivedInfo <p>The VPC configuration for the domain.</p>

---<p>Key-value pairs that specify advanced configuration options.</p>
---@alias azure.awsconnector.AwsOpenSearchDomainStatusPropertiesAdvancedOptionsMap { [string]: string }

