---@alias azure.awsconnector.AwsRdsDBSnapshotPropertiesTagListList azure.awsconnector.Tag_48[]

---Definition of awsRdsEventSubscription
---@class azure.awsconnector.AwsRdsEventSubscriptionProperties
---@field enabled? boolean A Boolean value; set to true to activate the subscription, set to false to create the subscription but not active it.
---@field eventCategories? azure.awsconnector.AwsRdsEventSubscriptionPropertiesEventCategoriesList A list of event categories for a SourceType that you want to subscribe to. You can see a list of the categories for a given SourceType in the Events topic in the Amazon RDS User Guide or by using the DescribeEventCategories action.
---@field snsTopicArn? string The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the SNS topic created for event notification. The ARN is created by Amazon SNS when you create a topic and subscribe to it.
---@field sourceIds? azure.awsconnector.AwsRdsEventSubscriptionPropertiesSourceIdsList The list of identifiers of the event sources for which events will be returned. If not specified, then all sources are included in the response. An identifier must begin with a letter and must contain only ASCII letters, digits, and hyphens; it cannot end with a hyphen or contain two consecutive hyphens.
---@field sourceType? string The type of source that will be generating the events. For example, if you want to be notified of events generated by a DB instance, you would set this parameter to db-instance. if this value is not specified, all events are returned.
---@field subscriptionName? string The name of the subscription.
---@field tags? azure.awsconnector.AwsRdsEventSubscriptionPropertiesTagsList An array of key-value pairs to apply to this resource.

---A list of event categories for a SourceType that you want to subscribe to. You can see a list of the categories for a given SourceType in the Events topic in the Amazon RDS User Guide or by using the DescribeEventCategories action.
