---Definition of ClusterSettings
---@class azure.awsconnector.ClusterSettings
---@field name? string The name of the cluster setting. The value is ``containerInsights`` .
---@field value? string The value to set for the cluster setting. The supported values are ``enabled`` and ``disabled``. If you set ``name`` to ``containerInsights`` and ``value`` to ``enabled``, CloudWatch Container Insights will be on for the cluster, otherwise it will be off unless the ``containerInsights`` account setting is turned on. If a cluster value is specified, it will override the ``containerInsights`` value set with [PutAccountSetting](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECS/latest/APIReference/API_PutAccountSetting.html) or [PutAccountSettingDefault](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECS/latest/APIReference/API_PutAccountSettingDefault.html).

