---Definition of EBSOptions
---@class azure.awsconnector.EBSOptions
---@field ebsEnabled? boolean <p>Indicates whether EBS volumes are attached to data nodes in an OpenSearch Service domain.</p>
---@field iops? number <p>Specifies the baseline input/output (I/O) performance of EBS volumes attached to data nodes. Applicable only for the <code>gp3</code> and provisioned IOPS EBS volume types.</p>
---@field throughput? number <p>Specifies the throughput (in MiB/s) of the EBS volumes attached to data nodes. Applicable only for the <code>gp3</code> volume type.</p>
---@field volumeSize? number <p>Specifies the size (in GiB) of EBS volumes attached to data nodes.</p>
---@field volumeType? azure.awsconnector.VolumeTypeEnumValue_2 <p>Specifies the type of EBS volumes attached to data nodes.</p>

