---@field resourceType? string The type of volume resource.
---@field tags? azure.awsconnector.EBSTagSpecificationTagsList The tags applied to this Amazon EBS volume. ``AmazonECSCreated`` and ``AmazonECSManaged`` are reserved tags that can't be used.

