---@field cloudWatchEncryptionEnabled? boolean Determines whether to use encryption on the CloudWatch logs. If not specified, encryption will be off.
---@field cloudWatchLogGroupName? string The name of the CloudWatch log group to send logs to. The CloudWatch log group must already be created.
---@field s3BucketName? string The name of the S3 bucket to send logs to. The S3 bucket must already be created.
---@field s3EncryptionEnabled? boolean Determines whether to use encryption on the S3 logs. If not specified, encryption is not used.
