---Definition of InstanceStatusEvent
---@class azure.awsconnector.InstanceStatusEvent
---@field code? azure.awsconnector.EventCodeEnumValue <p>The event code.</p>
---@field description? string <p>A description of the event.</p> <p>After a scheduled event is completed, it can still be described for up to a week. If the event has been completed, this description starts with the following text: [Completed].</p>
