---@class azure.awsconnector.IpRange
---@field cidrIp? string <p>The IPv4 address range. You can either specify a CIDR block or a source security group, not both. To specify a single IPv4 address, use the /32 prefix length.</p>
---@field description? string <p>A description for the security group rule that references this IPv4 address range.</p> <p>Constraints: Up to 255 characters in length. Allowed characters are a-z, A-Z, 0-9, spaces, and ._-:/()#,@[]+=&amp;;{}!$*</p>

