---@field logFilePrefix? string A prefix for all log object keys. If you store log files from multiple Amazon S3 buckets in a single bucket, you can use a prefix to distinguish which log files came from which bucket.
---@field targetObjectKeyFormat? azure.awsconnector.TargetObjectKeyFormat Amazon S3 key format for log objects. Only one format, either PartitionedPrefix or SimplePrefix, is allowed. Describes the key format for server access log file in the target bucket. You can choose between SimplePrefix and PartitionedPrefix.

