---Definition of WindowStartTime
---@class azure.awsconnector.WindowStartTime
---@field hours? number <p>The start hour of the window in Coordinated Universal Time (UTC), using 24-hour time. For example, <code>17</code> refers to 5:00 P.M. UTC.</p>
---@field minutes? number <p>The start minute of the window, in UTC.</p>

---Definition of ZoneAwarenessConfig
---@class azure.awsconnector.ZoneAwarenessConfig
---@field availabilityZoneCount? number <p>If you enabled multiple Availability Zones, this value is the number of zones that you want the domain to use. Valid values are <code>2</code> and <code>3</code>. If your domain is provisioned within a VPC, this value be equal to number of subnets.</p>

---@class azure.awsconnector.Options
---@field api_base_url? string from $AZURE_API_BASE_URL; default https://management.azure.com
---@field authority_host? string from $AZURE_AUTHORITY_HOST; default https://login.microsoftonline.com
---@field bearer_token? string|distilled.Secret|fun(host: table): (string|distilled.Secret|nil, distilled.Error?) from $AZURE_BEARER_TOKEN
---@field client_id? string from $AZURE_CLIENT_ID
---@field client_secret? string|distilled.Secret|fun(host: table): (string|distilled.Secret|nil, distilled.Error?) from $AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET
---@field scope? string default https://management.azure.com/.default
---@field subscription_id? string from $AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
---@field tenant_id? string from $AZURE_TENANT_ID
---@field host? table The host seams: transport, sleep, now, exec, random, getenv, epoch
---@field transport? fun(request: table): (table?, distilled.Error?)
---@field sleep? fun(seconds: number)
---@field now? fun(): number
---@field retry? string|table A retry preset or policy fields
---@field deadline_s? number Wall-clock budget for one call, sleeps included
---@field tracing? "off"|"operation"|"debug"|table
---@field validation? "lenient"|"additional"|"strict"
---@field [string] any

